ഒരേ പഴയ bowl മൂല്യം ഉപയോഗിച്ച് ഒരു post-stir-ന്റെ saved sum മുതൽ ആറു pending positions വരെ clean Appendix A formula പ്രകാരം ബന്ധിപ്പിക്കുന്ന Stage 1 പരീക്ഷണം.

Hamlet, എല്ലാ ആറു പഴയ കിണ്ണങ്ങൾക്കും ഒരേ test മൂല്യം സൂക്ഷിക്കുന്ന കഥാപാത്രം.
Juliet, stir നമ്പർ സൂക്ഷിക്കുന്ന കഥാപാത്രം.
Romeo, saved bowl sum സൂക്ഷിക്കുന്ന കഥാപാത്രം.
Othello, order position സൂക്ഷിക്കുന്ന കഥാപാത്രം.
Macbeth, square-നു മുൻപുള്ള s സൂക്ഷിക്കുന്ന കഥാപാത്രം.
Lady Macbeth, pending മൂല്യം സൂക്ഷിക്കുന്ന കഥാപാത്രം.
Portia, മഹാമനുഷ്യൻ സൂക്ഷിക്കുന്ന കഥാപാത്രം.
Viola, മഹാമനുഷ്യൻ നിർമ്മിക്കാനുള്ള എണ്ണം സൂക്ഷിക്കുന്ന കഥാപാത്രം.
Miranda, input-output സഹായിക്കുന്ന കഥാപാത്രം.

Act I: 1A saved value-ും ആറു post-stir positions-ും.

Scene I: uniform old bowl value-ും stir number-ും വായിക്കുന്നു.
[Enter Miranda and Hamlet]
Miranda:
 Listen to your heart.
[Exeunt]
[Enter Miranda and Juliet]
Miranda:
 Listen to your heart.
[Exeunt]

Scene II: മഹാമനുഷ്യൻ നിർമ്മിക്കുന്നു.
[Enter Portia and Viola]
Viola:
 You are a hero.
Portia:
 You are as good as the difference between a big big big big big big big hero and a hero.

Scene III: നൂറ്റിയിരുപത്തേഴു ഇരട്ടിക്കലുകൾ.
Portia:
 Are you better than nothing?
Viola:
 If not, let us proceed to scene IV.
 You are as good as the product of yourself and a big hero.
Portia:
 You are as good as the difference between yourself and a hero.
 Let us return to scene III.

Scene IV: മഹാമനുഷ്യന്റെ അവസാന കുറവ്.
Viola:
 You are as good as the difference between yourself and a hero.
[Exeunt]

Scene V: saved = SAVE(6 old + 149 stir).
[Enter Portia and Romeo]
Portia:
 You are as good as the product of the sum of a big big hero and a big hero and Hamlet.
 You are as good as the sum of yourself and the product of a big big big big big big big hero and Juliet.
 You are as good as the sum of yourself and the product of a big big big big hero and Juliet.
 You are as good as the sum of yourself and the product of a big big hero and Juliet.
 You are as good as the sum of yourself and Juliet.
 You are as good as the difference between yourself and a hero.
 You are as good as the remainder of the quotient between yourself and Portia.
 You are as good as the sum of yourself and a hero.
[Exeunt]

Scene VI: position ഒന്നിൽ തുടങ്ങുന്നു.
[Enter Miranda and Othello]
Miranda:
 You are a hero.

Scene VII: position ആറിന് മുകളിൽ ആണെങ്കിൽ അവസാനിപ്പിക്കുന്നു.
Miranda:
 Are you better than the sum of a big big hero and a big hero?
Othello:
 If so, let us proceed to scene XI.
[Exeunt]

Scene VIII: s = current + 3 prev + 5 next + saved + stir + position squared; uniform old snapshot ഉപയോഗിക്കുന്നു.
[Enter Miranda and Macbeth]
Miranda:
 You are as good as Hamlet.
 You are as good as the sum of yourself and the product of the sum of a big hero and a hero and Hamlet.
 You are as good as the sum of yourself and the product of the sum of a big big hero and a hero and Hamlet.
 You are as good as the sum of yourself and Romeo.
 You are as good as the sum of yourself and Juliet.
 You are as good as the sum of yourself and the product of Othello and Othello.
[Exeunt]

Scene IX: pending = SAVE(s squared + 7 prev next), പിന്നെ output.
[Enter Portia and Lady Macbeth]
Portia:
 You are as good as the product of Macbeth and Macbeth.
 You are as good as the sum of yourself and the product of the difference between a big big big hero and a hero and the product of Hamlet and Hamlet.
 You are as good as the difference between yourself and a hero.
 You are as good as the remainder of the quotient between yourself and Portia.
 You are as good as the sum of yourself and a hero.
[Exeunt]
[Enter Miranda and Lady Macbeth]
Miranda:
 Open your heart.
[Exeunt]

Scene X: അടുത്ത position.
[Enter Miranda and Othello]
Miranda:
 You are as good as the sum of yourself and a hero.
 Let us return to scene VII.

Scene XI: ഒരു post-stir round-ന്റെ ആറു pending positions പൂർത്തിയായി.
[Exeunt]
